'''Sam''' is an [[NPC]] that acts as a guide for {{zone|The Garden}}. '''Sam''' spawns on the player's island when they reach {{SkyBlock Level|5}}.

They teach the player how to unlock Garden Plots, use the [[Composter]], accept [[The Garden#Visitors|Visitor Offers]], and use the [[Greenhouse]].

