== Trivia ==
*'''Sam''' is one of the few [[NPC]]s that change name.
*When using certain [[Barn Skins]], such as the Cube Barn Skin, Sam is on the buildable area of the Barn and will float if the player has removed the blocks under her.
*During the initial questline, '''Sam''' asks for {{Item|Wheat|amount=100}} to make {{Item|Bread|amount=5}}, despite the fact that it only takes {{Item|Wheat|amount=15}} to craft.

